            "heading": "Fragrance Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Fragrance fills the room like a guitar resting in your arms, a limb that hangs as if it were always there. A heart that beats like a drum, strings pluck in rhythmic patterns, intertwined with trails of smoke, inhibition, and leather worn like your own identity.</p>",
            "page": ""
