        "collapsible_tab_RLzKp3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Crafted for the ones who live life in full volume, this candle is a tribute to the artistry of sound and design. A guitar pick, front and center, sets the tone on sleek glass embossed with six strings, a nod to the rhythm and craftsmanship behind every great song. Housed in a box inspired by the rich textures and stitched details of a classic guitar case, every element was designed with intention. From the tactile embossing to the structured packaging, it captures the spirit of iconic instruments and backstage moments. Light it up and let the room hum with warmth, a hint of nostalgia, a little edge, and a whole lot of soul.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_FwHw3t": {
