            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Burn Time: ~ 55 Hours</li><li>Fill (oz): 11</li><li>Fill (g/ml): 311</li><li>Natural Wick(s): 1</li><li>Vegan</li><li>Imperial Dimensions: 3.9 D x 3.9 H</li><li>Metric Dimensions: 99mm x 100mm</li></ul><p>806644090113</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_whdyYE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Trim wicks to 1/4” with each burn. Place candle on a heat resistant surface or candle tray. Allow wax to melt to the candle’s edge every burn to prevent tunneling. Keep candles away from drafts to ensure a smokeless, clean burn. Use a wick snuffer to extinguish a candle without soot or smoke. Discontinue burning a candle when less than 1/4” of wax remains.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
